# This starter has no required environment variables — all site-specific
# values live in src/config/retro-archive.ts instead.
#
# If you add Keystatic (https://keystatic.com) as a Git-backed CMS for the
# platforms/applications collections, it needs GitHub OAuth credentials in
# production (local dev uses local storage and needs none of this):
#
# KEYSTATIC_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
# KEYSTATIC_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# KEYSTATIC_SECRET=
#
# See docs/configuration.md for setup details.
